  <tei:text>
    <tei:body>
      <tei:div corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:prayer:hamavdil_bein_qodesh_leqodesh">
        <tei:p><tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hamavdil_bein_qodesh_leqodesh/1"/>Between the sanctity of Shabbos
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hamavdil_bein_qodesh_leqodesh/2"/>and the sanctity of Yom Tov
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hamavdil_bein_qodesh_leqodesh/3"/>You have distinguished,
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hamavdil_bein_qodesh_leqodesh/4"/>and the seventh day
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hamavdil_bein_qodesh_leqodesh/5"/>[from] the six work days You have sanctified.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hamavdil_bein_qodesh_leqodesh/6"/>You have distinguished and sanctified
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hamavdil_bein_qodesh_leqodesh/7"/>Your people Israel with Your holiness.
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hamavdil_bein_qodesh_leqodesh/8"/>Blessed are You, Adonoy
<tei:milestone unit="phrase" corresp="urn:x-opensiddur:text:metsudah:hamavdil_bein_qodesh_leqodesh/9"/>Who distinguished between sacred and sacred.</tei:p>
      </tei:div>
    </tei:body>
  </tei:text>
